<title>FINLAND: Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Dec - METLA.</title>
<headline>Finnish raw wood prices rise further in Dec - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices rose in December (weeks 49-52), building on their rises in August, September, October and November, the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Spruce pulpwood was the only category, in which prices fell, it said.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre)</p>
<p>    Dec '96    Nov '96   1995	  H2 '95	H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	  98.10	96.40    93.00	 93.20	 92.90</p>
<p> Spruce     123.40     123.60   109.70	109.00	110.20</p>
<p> Birch	 94.30	93.40    98.20	 98.00	 98.40</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre)</p>
<p>    Dec '96    Nov '96     1995	 H2 '95     H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	 248.00     247.00   247.10	 244.60     249.30</p>
<p> Spruce     205.60     204.90   197.60	 192.40     201.00</p>
<p> Birch	247.20     245.40   244.10	 240.70     246.70</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 248</p>
